"P620833426" "We're well on our way to getting our payoff for banishing the Wailer King known as Silvertongue. Learning his true name means all we need to get rid of the demon is to get an appropriate banishing ritual. Who knows more about binding and banishing demons than anyone? The Circle of Thorns. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Raid a Circle temple on Primeva and steal the Banishing Ritual of Gymon're and the necessary components for it.</A>"
